graph LR
    KF["kubeflow<br/>(notebook-controller +<br/>odh-notebook-controller)"]

    %% External dependencies
    KF -->|manager, webhooks, metrics| CR["controller-runtime v0.25.1"]
    KF -->|client/types| K8sLib["k8s.io client-go v0.37.1"]
    KF -->|HTTPRoute/ReferenceGrant types| GWAPI["gateway-api v1.2.1"]
    KF -->|OpenShift types, TLS profile| OSAPI["openshift/api + library-go"]
    KF -->|TLS profile watcher| CRC["openshift/controller-runtime-common"]
    KF -->|ingress resolver, TLS adherence| ODHUtil["odh-platform-utilities/framework"]
    KF -->|metrics| Prom["prometheus/client_golang v1.23.2"]
    KF -.->|tests only| OTel["OpenTelemetry v1.45.0"]
    KF -->|sidecar image| KRPImg["kube-rbac-proxy image"]
    KF -->|serving certs, CA bundle| ServiceCA["OpenShift service-ca"]

    %% Internal platform dependencies
    RHODS["rhods-operator<br/>(Workbenches)"] -->|deploys rhoai overlay| KF
    Dashboard["ODH Dashboard"] -->|creates Notebook CRs| KF
    KF -->|HTTPRoute CRUD, Gateway read| Gateway["data-science-gateway<br/>(openshift-ingress)"]
    KF -->|ImageStream resolution| WBImages["Workbench images<br/>(notebooks repo)"]
    KF -->|DSPA read, RoleBinding| DSPO["data-science-pipelines-operator"]
    KF -->|ClusterRole bind, tracking URI| MLflow["MLflow operator"]
    KF -->|ConfigMap mount| Feast["Feast operator"]
    KF -->|CA bundle copy| TrustedCA["odh-trusted-ca-bundle"]
    Monitoring["OpenShift monitoring"] -->|ServiceMonitor scrape| KF

    %% Platform APIs
    KF -->|REST + watch 6443| K8sAPI["Kubernetes API"]
    KF -->|APIServer / Proxy read| OSConfig["config.openshift.io"]
    KF -->|Route read| Routes["OpenShift Routes"]
    KF -.->|legacy delete| OAuth["OAuthClient (cleanup)"]

    %% Notebook pods
    KF -->|"HTTP/80 culling"| NBPods["Notebook pods"]

